    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #355\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to branch `bb/relay-145-system-i18n-02-05-migrate-system-selec-thr_9qtdg4qvnx`.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements issue #145: migrates every system `select`/`multi_select` property's `config.options` from a bare string array to `{ key: string, label?: string }[]`.\n\n- **`types.ts`**: adds the `SelectOption { key, label? }` type.\n- **`chokePoint/propertiesStore.ts`**: adds `assertValidSelectOptions`, wired into `createProperty` and `updatePropertyConfig`, rejecting the old bare-string shape on any new write.\n- **Seed files** (`seedTenDatabases.ts`, `seedInboxPipeline.ts`, `seedMcpModule.ts`, `seedEmailModule.ts`, `seedLibraryModule.ts`): the shared `selectConfig` helper now emits `{ key }` (no `label`) for shipped catalog options, since a shipped option's display text is not an override.\n- **`db/migrations/0029_select_option_keys.sql`**: backfills existing `properties.config.options` from bare strings to `{ key }` objects, idempotent (already-migrated objects/overrides pass through untouched), and aborts with the offending `properties.id` on malformed data — a bounded system-table `DO` block per the db-migrations skill's exception, not a queued backfill.\n- **`inboxPipeline.test.ts`**: updated structural assertions to the new options shape.\n- **`selectOptionKeysMigration.test.ts`** (new): covers upgrade, idempotency, override preservation, multi_select, non-select exemption, both malformed-data abort paths, and the new create/update validation paths.\n\nNo serializer or `filterCompiler.ts` currently reads `config.options`, so per the issue's own scope note, no further changes are needed until #147 wires the real translation catalog; typed filters are unaffected since item property values were never touched.\n\n**Verification**: `tsc -b`, `eslint`, migration-numbering check, and the full project suite (`pnpm run build && pnpm run test && pnpm run check:boundaries`) all pass — build across all 12 workspace packages, unit (16 files/114 tests), integration (67 files/783 tests), e2e (1 file/5 tests), and dependency-boundary check (1011 modules, 3525 dependencies, no violations).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
